{"id":"Prowl.Runtime.NavMeshModifier","name":"NavMeshModifier","display":"NavMeshModifier","kind":"class","assembly":"Prowl.Runtime","namespace":"Prowl.Runtime","outer":null,"signature":"public class NavMeshModifier : Component","bases":[{"name":"Component","id":"Prowl.Runtime.Component"}],"docs":{"summary":"Changes how this GameObject (and, by default, its children) contributes to navmesh bakes: exclude it entirely, or override the area its geometry is stamped with. Resolved at geometry-collection time — the nearest modifier up the hierarchy wins, an object's own modifier always beats an inherited one, and a modifier with [`ApplyToChildren`](#api~Prowl.Runtime.NavMeshModifier~ApplyToChildren) off covers only its own object. Changing a modifier does not rebake anything by itself; rebuild the surface (or the affected tiles) to apply. One modifier per GameObject: additional NavMeshModifier components on the same object are ignored."},"attributes":["AddComponentMenu","ComponentIcon"],"members":[{"kind":"property","name":"IgnoreFromBuild","signature":"public bool IgnoreFromBuild { get; set; }","docs":{},"static":false,"obsolete":false,"line":38,"path":"Prowl.Runtime/Components/Navigation/NavMeshModifier.cs","anchor":"IgnoreFromBuild"},{"kind":"property","name":"OverrideArea","signature":"public bool OverrideArea { get; set; }","docs":{},"static":false,"obsolete":false,"line":39,"path":"Prowl.Runtime/Components/Navigation/NavMeshModifier.cs","anchor":"OverrideArea"},{"kind":"property","name":"Area","signature":"public NavMeshArea Area { get; set; }","docs":{},"static":false,"obsolete":false,"line":40,"path":"Prowl.Runtime/Components/Navigation/NavMeshModifier.cs","anchor":"Area"},{"kind":"property","name":"ApplyToChildren","signature":"public bool ApplyToChildren { get; set; }","docs":{},"static":false,"obsolete":false,"line":41,"path":"Prowl.Runtime/Components/Navigation/NavMeshModifier.cs","anchor":"ApplyToChildren"},{"kind":"property","name":"AgentTypes","signature":"